@DocumentRecognition.WebApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5264

# Распознавание чертежа: отправьте PDF-файл в multipart/form-data (поле "file").
POST {{DocumentRecognition.WebApi_HostAddress}}/recognize
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----DrawingBoundary

------DrawingBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="drawing.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./drawing.pdf
------DrawingBoundary--

###
